{#-
  _row.html.j2: one font (site/CONTRACT.md, "A row"), included once per `row` of list.rows.
  Render moves whole li.font nodes and redraws only the .rank cell: a ranked font's score and
  its bar (hollow for a held font; owner rulings score_display and held_marker_style), or
  "Not ranked: <reason>". Its text is what screen readers hear: "Score 83 of 100". The title
  cell holds the heading and the specimen box, which takes the cell's full width (owner's site
  rulings of 2026-10-05, nerd_tag and score_centred). Where there is a specimen, the heading
  is centred on the box, over the name the box draws, and is hidden once the specimen shows
  (name_once); the score and its bar are centred on the box too. The specimen is hidden from
  screen readers, since the heading names the font (specimen_label_hidden). The box keeps its
  height whether or not the mask has arrived, since rows use content-visibility. A font with a
  Nerd Font build has the "Nerd Font available" tag among its badges. The row closes with the
  download link, which looks like the main button though it stays a link, then the quieter
  Details button (owner's site ruling of 2026-10-05, download_button). Kept compact: 540 of
  these ship in the no-cache HTML.
-#}
<li class="font{% if row.unranked %} is-unranked{% endif %}" id="font-{{ row.id }}" data-id="{{ row.id }}">
<div class="font-row">
{% if row.score is none %}
<span class="rank">{{ row.label }}</span>
{% else %}
<span class="rank{% if row.held %} is-held{% endif %}"><span class="visually-hidden">{{ list.score_words.before }}</span>{{ row.score }}<span class="visually-hidden">{{ list.score_words.after }}{% if row.held %}{{ list.score_words.held }}{% endif %}</span><i class="bar b{{ row.score }}"></i></span>
{% endif %}
<div class="font-title{% if row.specimen %} has-spec{% endif %}">
<h3 class="font-name" id="font-{{ row.id }}-name">{{ row.family }}</h3>
<div class="font-spec">
{% if row.specimen %}
<span class="spec" aria-hidden="true" data-src="{{ row.specimen.url }}"></span>
<noscript><img class="spec-img" src="{{ row.specimen.url }}" alt="" width="{{ row.specimen.width }}" height="{{ row.specimen.height }}" loading="lazy"></noscript>
{% elif row.fallback == "license" %}
<p class="spec-fallback">No preview: this font's license doesn't let us host its files. See it on <a href="{{ row.download.url }}">{{ row.download.label }}</a>.</p>
{% else %}
<p class="spec-fallback">Preview not available yet.</p>
{% endif %}
</div>
</div>
<p class="font-meta"><span class="font-cat">{{ row.category_label }}</span> <span class="font-lic">{{ row.license_name }}</span></p>
{% if row.badges %}
<ul class="badges" role="list" aria-label="Tags">
{% for badge in row.badges %}
<li class="badge" data-badge="{{ badge.key }}">{{ badge.text }}</li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
{% endif %}
<a class="download" href="{{ row.download.url }}">Download from {{ row.download.label }}<span class="visually-hidden"> ({{ row.family }})</span></a>
<button type="button" class="details-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="details-{{ row.id }}">Details<span class="visually-hidden"> for {{ row.family }}</span></button>
</div>
<div class="details" id="details-{{ row.id }}" hidden></div>
</li>
